1
00:01:15,439 --> 00:01:17,519
Why not find a fast courier

2
00:01:17,719 --> 00:01:19,359
to deliver the book?

3
00:01:21,719 --> 00:01:24,400
You have connections to the Moon?

4
00:01:24,439 --> 00:01:25,680
Why didn't you say so earlier?

5
00:01:30,040 --> 00:01:31,799
You're too busy

6
00:01:31,799 --> 00:01:33,879
to deal with such trivial matters.

7
00:01:34,239 --> 00:01:35,079
I...

8
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:37,439
I also like Mr. Cheng's poetry.

9
00:01:37,840 --> 00:01:39,719
I know his wife is a courier.

10
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:40,840
So,

11
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:43,159
why bother going so far?

12
00:01:43,799 --> 00:01:45,239
The escort team is already at hand.

13
00:01:45,519 --> 00:01:46,400
That's right.

14
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:47,719
Then let her go.

15
00:01:47,719 --> 00:01:48,319
No.

16
00:01:51,319 --> 00:01:53,040
From the Yun State to the Langyue State,

17
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,719
there will be many bandits on the way.

18
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:58,760
It's not worth risking my wife's life

19
00:01:58,799 --> 00:02:00,040
for these few books

20
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:01,400
of mine.

21
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:04,200
You have a point.

22
00:02:04,239 --> 00:02:06,079
Your wife's life is also important.

23
00:02:06,840 --> 00:02:07,879
Then let's trade.

24
00:02:10,039 --> 00:02:11,439
It's not a big deal.

25
00:02:11,599 --> 00:02:13,599
Since it's what the princess wants,

26
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:15,800
as long as she can enter the Langyue,

27
00:02:16,199 --> 00:02:17,800
I'll keep her safe.

28
00:02:18,439 --> 00:02:19,280
Good.

29
00:02:19,680 --> 00:02:20,280
Guards,

30
00:02:20,759 --> 00:02:22,960
take all the wine to the general's mansion.

31
00:02:27,080 --> 00:02:28,719
I always tell my father

32
00:02:28,840 --> 00:02:31,120
that you are the most loyal eagle of Langyue.

33
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:32,919
This cup, I toast to you.

34
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:56,639
Mr. Cheng,

35
00:02:57,039 --> 00:02:58,639
I admire your talent.

36
00:02:58,919 --> 00:03:00,800
Can we meet in private?

37
00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:04,599
I have no grudges against you.

38
00:03:04,639 --> 00:03:05,879
Why do you want to hurt the agency?

39
00:03:06,439 --> 00:03:08,199
When did I hurt the agency?

40
00:03:08,639 --> 00:03:09,919
You sent a fake escort before.

41
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:11,879
And now you're talking about going to Langyue.

42
00:03:12,039 --> 00:03:13,680
Are you planning another ambush

43
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:15,840
to make the agency the only escort agency?

44
00:03:17,319 --> 00:03:18,000
Mr. Su,

45
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:18,800
You've got me wrong.

46
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:19,759
Actually, last time,

47
00:03:20,159 --> 00:03:21,479
you were my escort.

48
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:23,960
I...

49
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:27,280
Look.

50
00:03:27,919 --> 00:03:29,599
The escort route from Yunjing to Langyue

51
00:03:29,599 --> 00:03:31,199
is very dangerous.

52
00:03:31,240 --> 00:03:32,840
If you don't have enough strength

53
00:03:32,840 --> 00:03:34,400
to reach Klak City safely,

54
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:35,199
how can you

55
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:37,560
travel between Yunjing and Langyue in the future?

56
00:03:42,199 --> 00:03:45,120
You work for the Princess.

57
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:51,120
You can rest assured to take the escort.

58
00:03:51,879 --> 00:03:52,960
Our Princess

59
00:03:54,039 --> 00:03:55,759
seems to be arrogant and domineering,

60
00:03:56,080 --> 00:03:57,800
but she cares about the people of Langyue.

61
00:03:58,199 --> 00:04:00,280
She has been biding her time,

62
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:02,000
waiting for the right moment.

63
00:04:02,719 --> 00:04:05,080
Now you are her chance.

64
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:08,599
Goodbye.

65
00:04:36,639 --> 00:04:38,040
Why did you drink so much last night?

66
00:04:38,439 --> 00:04:39,399
To numb yourself?

67
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:48,680
Why didn't you let me kill Yikeba?

68
00:04:49,839 --> 00:04:51,439
My father trusted him so much.

69
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:53,639
But he not only framed my father for treason,

70
00:04:53,839 --> 00:04:55,000
but also killed my whole family.

71
00:04:55,839 --> 00:04:58,000
But with your current ability,

72
00:04:58,040 --> 00:04:59,240
can you kill him?

73
00:05:00,079 --> 00:05:01,680
Even if you succeed in a sneak attack,

74
00:05:01,839 --> 00:05:03,160
the gate is heavily guarded.

75
00:05:03,319 --> 00:05:04,800
Do you have a way to escape?

76
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:07,560
Even if it takes a life to exchange for a life,

77
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:08,879
I must kill him.

78
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:12,079
I said if you want revenge,

79
00:05:12,079 --> 00:05:12,959
I'll help you.

80
00:05:14,399 --> 00:05:15,279
But

81
00:05:15,959 --> 00:05:17,560
you're always staring at Su Yuejiao.

82
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:18,759
I'm not happy about that.

83
00:05:22,639 --> 00:05:24,199
When Yikeba was chasing me,

84
00:05:25,240 --> 00:05:26,920
if it weren't for Su Yuejiao's mother,

85
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:28,720
I would have been dead.

86
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:31,240
I owe the Su family a life.

87
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:34,639
Repaying a favor or taking revenge,

88
00:05:34,800 --> 00:05:36,040
you can only choose one.

89
00:05:39,079 --> 00:05:39,879
I want to see her.

90
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:43,399
Then you have to hurry up.

91
00:05:43,800 --> 00:05:45,000
She's going back to Yunjing today.

92
00:05:47,800 --> 00:05:48,920
Before I change my mind.

93
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:00,720
Why are you here?

94
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:01,639
Where's the princess?

95
00:06:03,439 --> 00:06:04,639
Can we talk alone?

96
00:06:04,759 --> 00:06:05,519
What's the point?

97
00:06:05,879 --> 00:06:07,480
Haven't you done enough damage to the Escort Agency?

98
00:06:07,839 --> 00:06:08,800
You don't still like My Lord, do you?

99
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:10,199
You want to come back to the Agency with us?

100
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:14,120
I have to

101
00:06:14,360 --> 00:06:15,360
tell you something.

102
00:06:17,879 --> 00:06:19,519
Let's talk somewhere else.

103
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:31,319
Go ahead.

104
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:34,079
Do you want me to help you escape?

105
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:36,959
Are you willing to go back to Langyue with me?

106
00:06:37,759 --> 00:06:38,920
You want to go back to Langyue?

107
00:06:39,240 --> 00:06:40,439
Isn't that walking into a trap?

108
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:42,920
Yiguna is the princess of Langyue.

109
00:06:43,839 --> 00:06:45,639
My Lord, why don't you stop her?

110
00:06:46,439 --> 00:06:48,319
What if she really goes to Langyue?

111
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:51,079
She won't give up her escort agency.

112
00:06:51,639 --> 00:06:53,399
Bai Yanli is naive

113
00:06:53,399 --> 00:06:54,199
and stupid.

114
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:56,160
If she would refuse,

115
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:57,600
what are we here for?

116
00:06:58,240 --> 00:07:00,199
Just in case.

117
00:07:12,399 --> 00:07:13,160
You're afraid.

118
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:14,800
Then why did you let him go?

119
00:07:15,639 --> 00:07:17,319
If you don't let him go through this,

120
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:18,920
how can he give up?

121
00:07:19,279 --> 00:07:20,120
It makes sense,

122
00:07:20,639 --> 00:07:21,439
but not much.

123
00:07:22,839 --> 00:07:24,279
I'm the only son of a general of Langyue.

124
00:07:24,879 --> 00:07:25,519
Back then,

125
00:07:25,879 --> 00:07:27,399
my father was killed by the deputy general.

126
00:07:27,639 --> 00:07:28,600
Your mother saved me.

127
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:30,839
To avoid being killed,

128
00:07:31,240 --> 00:07:32,639
I had to wander in the Yun State,

129
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:33,879
hiding here and there.

130
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:36,360
I always wanted to go back to Langyue.

131
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:37,959
Only when I was a brigand,

132
00:07:37,959 --> 00:07:39,720
I could get close to Langyue without being suspected.

133
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:41,879
Over time,

134
00:07:42,399 --> 00:07:43,279
I became famous.

135
00:07:45,399 --> 00:07:46,399
I didn't expect

136
00:07:46,560 --> 00:07:47,800
you have such a background.

137
00:07:49,439 --> 00:07:50,480
Actually,

138
00:07:51,079 --> 00:07:52,480
I always felt sorry for my mother.

139
00:07:52,839 --> 00:07:54,680
She was always hunted for saving you.

140
00:07:55,680 --> 00:07:56,360
But

141
00:07:57,040 --> 00:07:58,040
you were a villain.

142
00:07:59,439 --> 00:08:01,519
I went to the agency not just to repay your kindness.

143
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:03,879
I met you

144
00:08:04,120 --> 00:08:04,879
in Ning'an

145
00:08:06,160 --> 00:08:07,079
and fell in love with you.

146
00:08:08,279 --> 00:08:09,439
I thought

147
00:08:09,839 --> 00:08:11,319
if you were willing to be with me,

148
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:12,959
I wouldn't go back.

149
00:08:17,360 --> 00:08:18,079
Wait.

150
00:08:18,519 --> 00:08:20,240
I escorted goods to Ning'an.

151
00:08:21,800 --> 00:08:22,600
Ning'an?

152
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:25,040
I've been to Ning'an.

153
00:08:26,399 --> 00:08:27,720
I know you're married,

154
00:08:28,079 --> 00:08:28,920
and I'm very upset.

155
00:08:29,720 --> 00:08:30,639
Then I learned

156
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:32,279
it's just a fake marriage,

157
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:33,679
I thought I had a chance.

158
00:08:33,679 --> 00:08:34,519
Fake marriage?

159
00:08:35,919 --> 00:08:37,320
It's a long story, Your Highness.

160
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:38,679
But I fell in love with my wife

161
00:08:38,799 --> 00:08:40,120
at first sight.

162
00:08:42,919 --> 00:08:43,519
But...

163
00:08:45,480 --> 00:08:46,960
But you made it real.

164
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:51,480
I don't remember anything.

165
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:54,960
Yes.

166
00:08:55,759 --> 00:08:56,840
I know you lost your memory.

167
00:08:57,840 --> 00:08:59,000
I'm even a little happy.

168
00:09:02,840 --> 00:09:04,320
Cheng Qi will only hurt you.

169
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:05,919
I won't.

170
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:08,639
I really like you.

171
00:09:09,320 --> 00:09:10,240
I can't stand it anymore.

172
00:09:10,639 --> 00:09:11,600
Don't, don't, don't.

173
00:09:11,879 --> 00:09:13,200
Don't be impulsive, don't be impulsive, Princess.

174
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:14,320
Don't be impulsive, don't be impulsive.

175
00:09:14,639 --> 00:09:17,120
Princess, listen to me.

176
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:19,480
Last time when he talked to Jiao,

177
00:09:19,600 --> 00:09:20,480
I interrupted them.

178
00:09:20,639 --> 00:09:21,399
This time,

179
00:09:21,399 --> 00:09:23,360
let me hear how Jiao answers.

180
00:09:28,120 --> 00:09:30,879
Are you willing to be with me?

181
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:48,320
No.

182
00:09:51,879 --> 00:09:53,279
Are you still thinking about Cheng Qi?

183
00:09:53,519 --> 00:09:54,120
Bai Yanli,

184
00:09:55,159 --> 00:09:56,720
no matter how much I remember,

185
00:09:56,960 --> 00:09:59,000
right now, the agency is all that matters.

186
00:10:00,120 --> 00:10:02,240
There are people I need to protect.

187
00:10:02,840 --> 00:10:05,720
Nothing can change my mind.

188
00:10:09,080 --> 00:10:09,960
As expected,

189
00:10:10,879 --> 00:10:11,840
I'm late for everything

190
00:10:12,360 --> 00:10:13,120
now.

191
00:10:13,960 --> 00:10:14,600
Bai,

192
00:10:15,159 --> 00:10:16,559
I believe you have

193
00:10:17,080 --> 00:10:18,799
more important things to do.

194
00:10:24,240 --> 00:10:25,279
I'm going back to Langyue

195
00:10:25,879 --> 00:10:26,840
to restore my father's reputation

196
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:28,320
and fulfill his wish

197
00:10:29,480 --> 00:10:31,720
and open up the trade route.

198
00:10:34,519 --> 00:10:36,600
Once the trade is established,

199
00:10:36,879 --> 00:10:38,720
I'll have General Bai on my side.

200
00:10:44,240 --> 00:10:45,600
This is what my mother left me.

201
00:10:45,919 --> 00:10:47,200
It bears the emblem of my family.

202
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:48,320
Take it.

203
00:10:50,440 --> 00:10:51,840
When you escort goods to the border,

204
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:53,000
my men

205
00:10:53,639 --> 00:10:54,919
and the wolf warriors

206
00:10:55,480 --> 00:10:56,480
will see it as seeing me.

207
00:10:56,600 --> 00:10:57,159
They'll help you.

208
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:00,960
Then this time,

209
00:11:01,279 --> 00:11:02,080
I won't hold back.

210
00:11:04,799 --> 00:11:06,480
I was supposed to give it to you at Yun Bridge.

211
00:11:07,159 --> 00:11:07,879
But...

212
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:11,919
Yun Bridge?

213
00:11:21,720 --> 00:11:23,440
What about the words you said at Yun Bridge?

214
00:11:24,759 --> 00:11:25,840
I've held a wedding ceremony with you,

215
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:26,879
and we've shared a wedding night.

216
00:11:27,240 --> 00:11:28,559
You are my wife.

217
00:11:28,600 --> 00:11:29,480
What nonsense are you talking about?

218
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:30,639
Who shared a wedding night with you?

219
00:11:30,799 --> 00:11:32,080
We've had a wedding ceremony

220
00:11:32,639 --> 00:11:33,039
and a wedding feast

221
00:11:33,039 --> 00:11:34,039
in Ning'an.

222
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:39,840
Jiao,

223
00:11:41,039 --> 00:11:42,240
I'll marry no one but you.

224
00:11:42,759 --> 00:11:43,639
I'm sticking with you.

225
00:11:48,600 --> 00:11:51,039
Those are just empty words to please a woman.

226
00:11:52,240 --> 00:11:54,120
I've said them to everyone in the pleasure quarters.

227
00:12:07,120 --> 00:12:08,200
Between us,

228
00:12:09,519 --> 00:12:11,200
there's only falsehood left.

229
00:12:11,399 --> 00:12:12,759
We were never meant to be together.

230
00:12:13,759 --> 00:12:15,759
Now I'm the head of Xingyun.

231
00:12:16,679 --> 00:12:18,000
Who would want to

232
00:12:18,039 --> 00:12:19,480
fall back into the mud?

233
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:21,279
Go to the escort agency,

234
00:12:21,799 --> 00:12:22,799
and be a live-in son-in-law?

235
00:12:32,720 --> 00:12:33,600
Cheng Qi.

236
00:12:56,840 --> 00:12:58,000
I know you're upset.

237
00:12:58,240 --> 00:12:59,240
If you want to cry,

238
00:12:59,360 --> 00:13:00,519
I'm here for you.

239
00:13:01,320 --> 00:13:01,840
No need.

240
00:13:04,360 --> 00:13:06,000
You still want to go with her, don't you?

241
00:13:07,399 --> 00:13:08,279
I won't go.

242
00:13:13,720 --> 00:13:15,279
You came to me first.

243
00:13:15,720 --> 00:13:16,080
Tell me.

244
00:13:16,440 --> 00:13:17,080
What do you want?

245
00:13:21,679 --> 00:13:22,440
I want revenge.

246
00:13:22,799 --> 00:13:23,200
Help me.

247
00:13:26,080 --> 00:13:28,360
If we are a family,

248
00:13:28,639 --> 00:13:29,679
I will definitely help you.

249
00:13:30,080 --> 00:13:31,159
I haven't forgotten her.

250
00:13:31,159 --> 00:13:31,960
I know.

251
00:13:32,279 --> 00:13:33,240
Then why are you still willing to...

252
00:13:33,759 --> 00:13:35,240
You'll be mine anyway.

253
00:13:36,200 --> 00:13:37,080
But

254
00:13:38,039 --> 00:13:39,480
what if Su Yuejiao accepts you?

255
00:13:44,039 --> 00:13:45,039
Stay by her side.

256
00:13:51,960 --> 00:13:53,600
Miss Su

257
00:13:54,639 --> 00:13:55,960
I don't take escort missions.

258
00:13:56,159 --> 00:13:57,399
Please behave yourself, Mr. Cheng.

259
00:13:58,360 --> 00:13:59,279
Don't take escort missions?

260
00:14:00,320 --> 00:14:01,919
When did the agency have such a rule?

261
00:14:02,200 --> 00:14:03,039
Now it has.

262
00:14:03,240 --> 00:14:04,960
Mr. Cheng, you'd better find another way.

263
00:14:07,799 --> 00:14:09,200
Miss Su

264
00:14:09,879 --> 00:14:10,679
Look,

265
00:14:11,279 --> 00:14:13,480
the road back is long and dangerous.

266
00:14:14,399 --> 00:14:15,720
I'm a weak scholar.

267
00:14:15,720 --> 00:14:16,639
If I go back,

268
00:14:16,879 --> 00:14:18,679
I'll be in great danger.

269
00:14:18,799 --> 00:14:20,000
Are you going to

270
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:21,360
just stand by and watch?

271
00:14:21,759 --> 00:14:23,200
You know our agency well.

272
00:14:23,440 --> 00:14:24,600
Of course.

273
00:14:24,840 --> 00:14:26,120
The agency is

274
00:14:28,519 --> 00:14:31,919
the best in the city.

275
00:14:33,039 --> 00:14:35,519
And a popular writer like me

276
00:14:35,639 --> 00:14:38,039
needs your protection.

277
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:39,879
Thank you for your trust.

278
00:14:41,440 --> 00:14:42,759
Then I...

279
00:14:43,279 --> 00:14:44,600
The rule is newly made.

280
00:14:44,600 --> 00:14:45,480
We don't take personal escort.

281
00:14:45,840 --> 00:14:46,600
Please go.

282
00:14:55,039 --> 00:14:55,799
Don't worry,

283
00:14:55,919 --> 00:14:57,720
I'll leave for Yunjing today.

284
00:15:01,200 --> 00:15:03,320
I don't want you to go.

285
00:15:04,320 --> 00:15:05,000
I don't care.

286
00:15:05,200 --> 00:15:06,600
You took my business,

287
