576
00:27:03,640 --> 00:27:04,720
It's better than doing chores.

577
00:27:05,799 --> 00:27:08,519
I won a lot of money playing cards.

578
00:27:08,519 --> 00:27:10,200
Jiaojiao, you can use it first.

579
00:27:10,359 --> 00:27:11,319
I can also make handicrafts

580
00:27:11,680 --> 00:27:13,079
to exchange for money.

581
00:27:13,079 --> 00:27:13,599
Jiaojiao,

582
00:27:14,000 --> 00:27:15,640
believe in my face,

583
00:27:17,079 --> 00:27:19,519
You should believe in my luck.

584
00:27:20,839 --> 00:27:22,480
You should believe in my brother's skill.

585
00:27:26,839 --> 00:27:28,160
Then you should believe in my

586
00:27:28,880 --> 00:27:29,640
appetite.

587
00:27:32,279 --> 00:27:34,240
The point now is not lack of money,

588
00:27:34,400 --> 00:27:36,400
but to restore the reputation of the Escort Agency.

589
00:27:36,799 --> 00:27:38,799
Let everyone know that we are reliable,

590
00:27:38,839 --> 00:27:40,480
not a black shop that steals goods.

591
00:27:41,680 --> 00:27:42,119
My Lord.

592
00:27:42,400 --> 00:27:43,160
Come with me.

593
00:27:44,200 --> 00:27:44,960
Leave a piece of rib.

594
00:27:46,640 --> 00:27:47,079
Well,

595
00:27:48,720 --> 00:27:49,799
it is said that

596
00:27:50,400 --> 00:27:52,240
there are many rich men's in-laws,

597
00:27:52,640 --> 00:27:54,279
but rarely

598
00:27:54,279 --> 00:27:55,400
armoury agency in-laws.

599
00:27:56,119 --> 00:27:58,359
To know the way of survival of the agency,

600
00:27:58,839 --> 00:28:01,920
just listen to me.

601
00:28:03,039 --> 00:28:03,720
Good.

602
00:28:03,839 --> 00:28:06,519
It is said that the Su's Agency in Yunjing

603
00:28:06,640 --> 00:28:09,599
is famous for its motto: "I'll protect the goods until I die".

604
00:28:10,240 --> 00:28:11,839
The young female head

605
00:28:11,839 --> 00:28:12,920
is upright and forthright.

606
00:28:13,119 --> 00:28:15,400
But in order to protect her own escort order,

607
00:28:15,640 --> 00:28:19,079
she fell into the trap of the cunning scholar.

608
00:28:19,839 --> 00:28:21,000
The scholar

609
00:28:21,039 --> 00:28:23,200
fell in love at first sight

610
00:28:23,680 --> 00:28:24,960
when he first saw the female head.

611
00:28:25,599 --> 00:28:29,440
By some strange coincidence, he set a trap

612
00:28:29,599 --> 00:28:32,079
to trick the female head into marrying him.

613
00:28:32,920 --> 00:28:35,599
The scholar lied and set up a trap for the female head.

614
00:28:36,480 --> 00:28:38,799
If the two of them can really end up together,

615
00:28:39,200 --> 00:28:40,680
it's a good thing.

616
00:28:44,359 --> 00:28:45,119
Good thing?

617
00:28:45,359 --> 00:28:46,880
Have you asked her opinion?

618
00:28:47,079 --> 00:28:49,200
He is a playboy who deceives women.

619
00:28:50,400 --> 00:28:51,200
That's it.

620
00:28:51,839 --> 00:28:52,319
Gong Xi

621
00:28:52,839 --> 00:28:53,640
What's going on?

622
00:28:54,039 --> 00:28:55,880
My lord, he's reading the storybook.

623
00:28:56,079 --> 00:28:58,400
He said you like it.

624
00:28:59,079 --> 00:28:59,880
I don't know him.

625
00:29:00,200 --> 00:29:01,960
Don't let him make trouble in front of the escort agency.

626
00:29:03,440 --> 00:29:04,640
I told you before.

627
00:29:05,079 --> 00:29:06,240
My Lord lost his memory.

628
00:29:06,240 --> 00:29:07,400
He doesn't remember Cheng Qi.

629
00:29:07,839 --> 00:29:09,039
How dare he call himself my son-in-law?

630
00:29:09,039 --> 00:29:10,000
Watch out for a beating.

631
00:29:10,319 --> 00:29:12,799
The book "The Daily Life of the Men-in-law in the Escort Agency"

632
00:29:13,079 --> 00:29:15,400
is only two pence now.

633
00:29:15,440 --> 00:29:17,119
Two pence?

634
00:29:17,119 --> 00:29:19,400
Good.

635
00:29:23,279 --> 00:29:25,240
You can change a place to sell it.

636
00:29:25,480 --> 00:29:26,160
No.

637
00:29:27,119 --> 00:29:28,440
The rent of the escort agency...

638
00:29:28,599 --> 00:29:29,079
Grandpa.

639
00:29:29,079 --> 00:29:29,559
I paid it.

640
00:29:30,440 --> 00:29:31,599
It's quite a lot.

641
00:29:32,279 --> 00:29:35,359
You have to pay compensation for breach of contract.

642
00:29:39,119 --> 00:29:42,000
Is my family so poor?

643
00:29:43,519 --> 00:29:46,200
Didn't you say the escort agency needs to gather people?

644
00:29:46,279 --> 00:29:47,799
This guy can gather people,

645
00:29:48,000 --> 00:29:49,839
and can also pay us money.

646
00:29:49,839 --> 00:29:50,440
How good!

647
00:29:54,079 --> 00:29:54,960
Well.

648
00:29:55,240 --> 00:29:55,839
You

649
00:29:56,319 --> 00:29:58,000
should move over there.

650
00:29:58,119 --> 00:29:59,559
In case Jiaojiao sees it

651
00:29:59,799 --> 00:30:00,720
and wants to listen.

652
00:30:01,839 --> 00:30:02,359
Okay.

653
00:30:07,480 --> 00:30:08,200
Gong Xi, Fai Cai.

654
00:30:13,000 --> 00:30:14,599
How can we let the guests stand and listen to the book?

655
00:30:14,799 --> 00:30:15,799
Go get some low stools.

656
00:30:15,880 --> 00:30:17,240
And some tea and snacks.

657
00:30:17,599 --> 00:30:18,599
My Lord.

658
00:30:19,400 --> 00:30:21,799
If you need anything, just tell us.

659
00:30:21,839 --> 00:30:23,240
You can order at any time.

660
00:30:23,240 --> 00:30:26,559
Good, good, good.

661
00:30:27,599 --> 00:30:29,119
I said the divorce was fake, right?

662
00:30:29,160 --> 00:30:30,400
Didn't she just drive him away?

663
00:30:31,079 --> 00:30:32,079
I guess they quarreled.

664
00:30:32,440 --> 00:30:33,799
Quarrel in bed, make up in bed.

665
00:30:33,920 --> 00:30:35,119
Yes, yes, yes.

666
00:30:42,400 --> 00:30:43,680
Tell me the truth.

667
00:30:44,079 --> 00:30:46,480
Do you really not remember Cheng Qi?

668
00:30:47,920 --> 00:30:49,279
I didn't remember before.

669
00:30:50,400 --> 00:30:51,200
But now you remember.

670
00:30:52,319 --> 00:30:53,079
And then?

671
00:30:55,640 --> 00:30:58,480
I got hurt on the head in the City of Klak.

672
00:30:58,799 --> 00:31:01,359
It took me a while to remember people and things.

673
00:31:01,680 --> 00:31:03,359
Everyone always talks about him in front of me.

674
00:31:03,799 --> 00:31:04,640
So I remember.

675
00:31:05,839 --> 00:31:07,480
Then why do you pretend not to remember?

676
00:31:08,519 --> 00:31:09,960
I don't want to go back to the past.

677
00:31:10,559 --> 00:31:13,839
It's good to treat him as a stranger.

678
00:31:15,799 --> 00:31:18,680
You really don't plan to forgive him?

679
00:31:19,279 --> 00:31:20,759
I don't have much ground

680
00:31:20,759 --> 00:31:22,359
to say forgive or not forgive.

681
00:31:23,000 --> 00:31:25,400
I just want to focus on the Escort Agency.

682
00:31:27,480 --> 00:31:28,000
Right.

683
00:31:29,720 --> 00:31:30,880
The Escort Agency is the most important.

684
00:31:31,000 --> 00:31:32,559
Otherwise, where will I live in the future?

685
00:31:33,440 --> 00:31:35,799
Don't worry. I can't let you suffer.

686
00:31:36,599 --> 00:31:40,319
But he's telling stories at the door of the Escort Agency now,

687
00:31:40,400 --> 00:31:42,799
which has brought some popularity back to the Agency.

688
00:31:44,720 --> 00:31:47,440
Did you forget how he hurt you at that time?

689
00:31:48,240 --> 00:31:50,640
Jiaojiao, if you don't want to accept him,

690
00:31:50,799 --> 00:31:52,039
I'll help you get rid of him.

691
00:31:53,680 --> 00:31:55,000
I heard that

692
00:31:55,839 --> 00:31:58,319
the best way to forget someone

693
00:31:58,400 --> 00:32:00,680
is to find a new person to replace him.

694
00:32:01,000 --> 00:32:02,119
Leave it to me.

695
00:32:03,279 --> 00:32:03,720
No.

696
00:32:03,839 --> 00:32:06,079
I don't want to get into a worse situation.

697
00:32:06,640 --> 00:32:08,759
Let me run the Escort Agency well first.

698
00:32:11,319 --> 00:32:13,920
It's mine.

699
00:32:17,920 --> 00:32:18,839
Miss

700
00:32:19,160 --> 00:32:20,599
You have placed orders for three days in a row.

701
00:32:20,920 --> 00:32:22,640
Let me take the stool home for you.

702
00:32:22,839 --> 00:32:24,839
I appreciate your trust in the Escort Agency,

703
00:32:25,000 --> 00:32:27,319
but can I ask why?

704
00:32:27,839 --> 00:32:29,400
If we take 15 orders a day,

705
00:32:29,440 --> 00:32:30,240
no matter how big or small,

706
00:32:30,240 --> 00:32:32,279
we can ask Mr. Cheng to tell a new chapter.

707
00:32:33,079 --> 00:32:34,720
So I'm counting on you.

708
00:32:35,039 --> 00:32:36,839
It was very dangerous.

709
00:32:40,079 --> 00:32:40,880
Gong Xi

710
00:32:41,240 --> 00:32:42,640
You go tell Mr. Cheng later

711
00:32:43,079 --> 00:32:45,119
that two new chapters will be told for the employer today.

712
00:32:45,279 --> 00:32:46,039
My treat.

713
00:32:46,039 --> 00:32:47,799
My Lord, can we go too?

714
00:32:48,319 --> 00:32:50,200
No, we should go escort.

715
00:32:51,799 --> 00:32:52,920
Be careful.

716
00:32:53,039 --> 00:32:54,640
The phoenix coronet and robes.

717
00:32:55,200 --> 00:32:56,839
My Lord wants to invite you to the Yue Lao Pavilion.
